     "text": "For some days a road roller has come to the author’s village to surface its dirt road — a mountain of black iron, heavy like a Japanese sumo wrestler, whose job is to press a layer of gravel onto the fragrant raw earth. Children and dogs gave it a noisy welcome at first, but within days the wonder faded, and it now moves slowly back and forth all day with its old driver. In the evening, when the driver locks its cabin and leaves, the author comes and gazes at this “wonder of the age”.",
