     "text": "Syed Mir Ahmad Shah Bukhari was born in Peshawar. From childhood his nature was spirited. At only thirteen he joined the “Naujawan Bharat Sabha”, which played a militant role in the freedom movement. During the freedom movement and, after the creation of Pakistan, in the struggle for democracy and freedom of expression, he repeatedly endured the hardships of imprisonment.",
