     "text": "Syed Hasan Rizvi Shakeeb Jalali was born in the town of Jalali, district Aligarh. He received his early education in Badayun. Shakeeb Jalali's economic condition was poor from the beginning; because of his father's illness the responsibility of the whole household fell on him. After the creation of Pakistan he came to Pakistan and did his B.A. from Lahore. At first he worked in the offices of magazines, then joined the Education Department. His whole life passed in anguish, sorrow and bitterness. He was often ill and in the end had developed several mental and psychological ailments. He left this world at the age of only 32.",
